  "content": "<h1>🔃 熱更新資源包 Forked 版 📦</h1><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_64h.png\" alt=\"fabric\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fquiltmc.org%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/quilt_64h.png\" alt=\"quilt\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/forge_64h.png\" alt=\"forge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/8494ec1ac495cfb481dc7e458356325510933eb0/assets/cozy/supported/neoforge_64h.png\" alt=\"neoforge\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Alfakynz/hot-reload-resource-packs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/github_64h.png\" alt=\"github\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fKsOce7sT\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_64h.png\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hot-reload-resource-packs-forked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_64h.png\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/TcmUQHZ5U4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_64h.png\" alt=\"discord-plural\"></a></p><h2>✨ 特色功能</h2><ul>\n<li>當 resourcepacks 資料夾內容變更時，自動重新載入資源包（源自原始<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252f8xOCApGi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">模組</a>）。</li>\n<li>在 Linux 和 macOS 上防止 reloadResources() 被呼叫兩次</li>\n<li>移植至 Forge 和 NeoForge</li>\n<li>支援 Resourcify</li>\n</ul><h2>🔄 支援版本</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Minecraft</th>\n<th>Fabric</th>\n<th>Forge</th>\n<th>NeoForge</th>\n<th>Quilt</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1.18.x</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.19.x</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.20.1</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.20.2</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.20.3</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.20.4</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.20.5</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.20.6</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.21.1</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.21.2</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.21.3</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.21.4</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.21.5</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.21.6</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.21.7</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.21.8</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.21.9</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.21.10</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.21.11</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>26.1.x</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>26.2.x</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p>Fabric &gt;= 0.13.0 / 0.18.4 <br>\nNeoForge &gt;= 21.1.219 / 26.1.0.1-beta / 26.2.0.1-beta <br>\nForge &gt;= 47.0.19</p><h2>🙏 致謝</h2><ul>\n<li>感謝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252f161u4TUg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">carterisonline</a> 的原始<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252f8xOCApGi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">模組</a></li>\n<li>感謝 <a href=\"https://github.com/johndrinkwater\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">johndrinkwater</a> 提交了<a href=\"https://github.com/carterisonline/hot-reload-resource-packs/pull/1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">#1</a> 拉取請求，防止了 reloadResources() 被重複呼叫</li>\n</ul><h2>📦 模組包</h2><p>歡迎將熱更新資源包 Forked 版加入模組包中。</p><h2>🌐 需要伺服器嗎？同時支持我！</h2><p>想和朋友一起玩嗎？透過 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252fwildlight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wabbanode</a> 獲取您的專屬伺服器。</p><p>使用代碼 <strong>WILDLIGHT</strong> 即可支持我並享有 75 折優惠。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252fwildlight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/hvk4z0Vv/banner-3.png\" alt=\"Wabbanode 伺服器\"></a></p>",
